    ],
    //  Hinged at the bottom of the rear panel (axis y 2.170 z 0.570): the front edge lifts, the
    //  lid swings up and back like the Taxi 2 406, letting the spoiler sink into / rise out of
    //  the trunk. No latch and no trunk button: lid hydros, driven by craptechReverseLid.lua,
    //  hold it shut. Each hydro has its own input set from the exact lid angle.
